#: search2:search2_B52EAB6A_CF13_4FC3_8BDF_A4DD04E6FFD6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71f37b7603be32dd6da665bea33fa31b7dbd40fd17ce945ad7c21c91a5b442ff
