#: search2:search2_1C79017E_0AE9_4356_A168_DBABF3358EFE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65d8154842f33931441ef601e6d2068b1c4f87914eb87720a4a8cb0ae193f457
